# ai-marketing-agent-private Development Guidelines

Auto-generated from feature plans + project constitution. Last updated: 2026-02-23

## Active Technologies
- Python 3.11 (backend), Node 20 (frontend); Docker Compose V2 for orchestration. + FastAPI/uvicorn (backend), Next.js 14 (frontend), shadcn/ui, ruff (linter). (002-migrate-dev-practices)
- MongoDB 4.4 (Docker container, port 27017). (002-migrate-dev-practices)

- **Backend**: Python 3.11, FastAPI/uvicorn — port 8088
- **Frontend**: Node 20, Next.js 14 (React + TypeScript) — port 3001
- **Database**: MongoDB 4.4 (Docker) — port 27017
- **Orchestration**: Docker Compose V2 (`docker compose`); compose file at repo root `docker-compose.yml`
- **AI Providers**: Database-driven via `ai_providers` collection; never hardcoded

## Project Structure

```text
app/                        # FastAPI backend
  api/v1/endpoints/         # Thin controllers
  services/                 # Business logic
  db/                       # Database access (Motor)
  ai_providers/             # AI provider integrations
frontend/                   # Next.js frontend
  src/app/[locale]/         # Pages (i18n)
  src/components/           # UI components (shadcn/ui)
  src/services/             # API clients
  src/i18n/locales/         # Translations (en, pt)
tests/unit/                 # Backend unit tests (pytest)
tests/integration/          # Integration tests
tests/frontend/             # Frontend debug tools
docs/                       # Architecture docs
spec/                       # Spec Kit SDD
  constitution/             # project-constitution.speckit.md
  process/                  # Process specs
  features/                 # Feature specs
  tasks/                    # Task lists
specs/                      # Active feature specs (specify CLI)
.vscode/tasks.json          # IDE tasks (Start/Stop full dev environment)
docker-compose.yml          # Repo root; all services as containers
```

## Commands

```bash
# Start full development environment (all services via Docker Compose V2)
# Use IDE task: "Start full development environment"  OR:
docker compose up -d --wait

# Stop full development environment
docker compose down

# Backend
uvicorn app.main:api_app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8088 --reload

# Frontend
cd frontend && npm run dev

# Backend tests
pytest

# Linting
ruff check .
```

## Code Style

- **Python**: PEP 8, type hints, docstrings on all functions
- **TypeScript**: No `any`; use types from `@/types`; functional React components; hooks at top level only
- **i18n**: Use `getTranslations()` from `@/i18n` (not `next-intl`); loading guard: `if (loading || !t.pages) return <LoadingState />;`
- **Errors**: Never `alert()`; use `<AIErrorDisplay>` with `error_details` and `correlation_id`
- **Commits**: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, etc.)

